  "text": "Before wiring everything up, know three real-world trade-offs. First is context window bloat. Every connected tool sends its description along with your prompt, so wiring up a hundred tools can quietly burn thousands of tokens before you even speak—raising costs and confusing the model. Keep only focused servers enabled, or use dynamic tool search.",
